{"articleNo":"2104","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2104&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"창업지원 및 Mock-up(시제품) 제작비 지원 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.11.07","hit":"8066","attachments":[{"name":"Mock-Up 관련.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2104&attachNo=69580"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 30pt\">창업지원 및 Mock-up(시제품) 제작비 지원 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1. 목적 : 재학생 청년창업 지원을 통한 일자리 창출, 창업에 필요한 시제품 제작지원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. 지원대상/조건 : 창업동아리 또는 재학생으로 구성된 개인 또는 팀(3인이상)으로서&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">창업을 준비 중인 자 또는 창업 1년 미만인 자 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. 지원금액 : 최대 1,000만원 (평가 후 차등지원)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. 진행절차</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 신청서 및 사업계획서 접수 : 2011. 11. 30(수)까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 선정 및 지원 : 2011. 12. 9(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 결과물 제출 : 2011. 1. 31(화)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">◈ 신청안내 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2011. 11. 30.(수) 까지</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 신청방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #009900; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">참가신청서 + 사업계획서</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">(첨부파일)를 센터로 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">직접 제출</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">◈ 문의사항 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">그린에너지시스템인재양성센터 행정실 그린에너지관 401호&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -94.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 94.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Tel.) 054-478-7931, E-mail) killer3214@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -94.1p